 the fresh air, and escape the hustle and bustle of daily life. Along the way, you can communicate with friends, sharing stories, laughter, and experiences, either through old-fashioned conversations or modern technology. Whether you're gathered around a campfire beneath the stars or lounging in a hammock with a view of the canopy, the combination of nature, tranquillity, and meaningful connection will make for unforgettable memories.", "short_description": "Fun Monkey Locomotion Based Game"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/privacyatagsss/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Coast", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/aura-tag-3/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "8519939421466013"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001694_624149286601809_8696616133042029572_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TTCz3TggPPwQ7kNvwF5K5T_&_nc_oc=AdkSTY_esSf5dyrqXG1M37Y8GRS9GxB8uZw8qcbxyWed81MUSM0X4Lhv84XoBGaSg5U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzMsvSRhwuOf5yCpGx_hJlZSTnVa76LncIpzmtGbS06kw&oe=69AED181"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Au